      <title>报道称：印尼、加拿大、日韩及墨西哥在APEC期间密集推进对华经贸与外交对话</title>
      <link>https://soulmove.github.io/daily-news-ai/?batch=smart-20261119-155131&amp;cat=global&amp;event=evt_441876d0d486</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261119-155131:evt_441876d0d486</guid>
